  "prefLabel": "Rev 3401.17 Supplemental",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 3401.17 “Supplemental” means a subsequent filing by an owner, in a tax year, of Form PA-7, “Notice of Intent to Cut Wood or Timber”, with the municipal assessing officials to make corrections or additions to the information provided in the original filed Form PA-7.\n\nSource. #10664, eff 9-4-14; ss by #14026, eff 7-16-24 (formerly Rev 3401.18)",
